<title>USA: Fed buys coupons 11/15/07 to 2/15/27.</title>
<headline>Fed buys coupons 11/15/07 to 2/15/27.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said on Thursday that it bought coupons in 10-year notes and up.</p>
<p>The Fed bought coupons ranging from November 15, 2007 to February 15, 2027. They are for Friday delivery and dealers have until 1120 EDT/1520 GMT to respond.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1867 ))</p>
</text>
